For a library or package, you might want to ignore these files since they are
intended to be used within repositories of that project
.python-version
pipenv
According to pypa/pipenv#598, it is recommended to check in Pipfile.lock into version control.
However, in case of ecosystem workflows, you can choose to ignore pipenv locks.
pipenv.lock
Poetry
Similar to Pipfile.lock, it is generally recommended to check poetry.lock into version control.
This is especially true for binary packages to ensure reproducible builds.
poetry.lock
